{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV節目《港出好味道》最新一集來到荷蘭Zwolle，主持Ivy與Kit跟隨移居當地的餐廳老闆Terren …</p><p></p>\n<p>ViuTV節目《港出好味道》最新一集來到荷蘭Zwolle，主持Ivy與Kit跟隨移居當地的餐廳老闆Terrence體驗狂歡節慶。節目中眾人不僅品嚐地道冠軍薯條與小食，Terrence更在鏡頭前示範一道打破傳統常規的港式叉燒。這款加入特殊秘方的招牌菜不僅震撼主持味蕾，更在網上掀起熱烈討論。</p>\n<h2>Ivy與Kit現身Zwolle街頭狂歡並品嚐地道冠軍薯條</h2>\n<p>節目中Ivy與Kit跟隨Terrence穿梭荷蘭Zwolle市中心，感受當地人享受陽光與節慶熱鬧氣氛。三人特意前往當地一間榮獲報章評選冠軍殊榮小食店，品嚐新鮮即炸香脆薯條與特製炸肉卷。面對外脆內軟兼帶有洋蔥咖喱香氣地道美食，主持們食到停不了口。Ivy品嚐香脆蜜糖餅時更直指餅乾外層十分爽脆，並將整塊蜜糖餅迅速吃完。</p>\n<h2>老闆Terrence親爆改良叉燒秘訣</h2>\n<p>狂歡過後眾人返回中餐廳廚房，Terrence親自向主持展示其首創港式招牌菜。他向鏡頭解釋這道菜式做法與香港大同小異，但會在最後加上蜜糖與檸檬汁走油，並強調「檸檬汁配嗰個蜜糖呢，係冇得頂」。Ivy試食後大讚肉質鬆化且完全沒有羶味，直言這款特製蜜糖檸檬汁令整碟叉燒「回魂」。Terrence表示為了適應荷蘭人口味與餐廳出菜速度，這款叉燒經過多次測試與改良才正式出爐。</p>\n<h2>兩代人共同經營荷蘭中餐館展現出極致餐飲專業</h2>\n<p>這間中餐館原本由Terrence父親創立，目前廚房仍由工作超過30年叔叔及姑丈坐鎮。Terrence接手後決定推行革新，不僅打破傳統引入餐酒搭配觀念，更親自從香港及中國內地試食取經。他透露每次尋找新靈感後都會與長輩商量，坦言「如果繼續想有個future啦，中餐呢一定要改翻革新潮流」。目前餐廳在當地華人與荷蘭人圈子中均累積了大批長期捧場客。</p>\n<h2>創新港式菜餚 大量觀眾與網民熱議</h2>\n<p>節目播出後隨即在各大網上討論區引發極大迴響，不少觀眾對這款檸檬蜜糖叉燒表示高度關注。有網民留言表示「估唔到荷蘭都有咁正宗又創新港式美食」，亦有人讚賞Terrence在傳承與創新之間取得完美平衡。部分心水清網民更指出廚房內兩代人合作無間非常難得，紛紛留言指出「一家人齊心合力搞好間餐廳好感動」。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472032138925855_15747814556af942424539c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Ivy與老闆Terrence親身落場協助餐館招呼客人。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472032138925855_15747814556af942424539c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy與老闆Terrence親身落場協助餐館招呼客人。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794720328470424_16908900566af9424924926.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Terrence示範製作港式叉燒，並巧妙加入檸檬汁與蜜糖調味，令肉質更添層次與回味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794720328470424_16908900566af9424924926.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Terrence示範製作港式叉燒，並巧妙加入檸檬汁與蜜糖調味，令肉質更添層次與回味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-15-3.06.15_8297841776af95a52d2a0e-1024x576.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Kit和Ivy試食Terrence店首創的破格叉燒，大呼好味道。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-15-3.06.15_8297841776af95a52d2a0e-1024x576.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Kit和Ivy試食Terrence店首創的破格叉燒，大呼好味道。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472036444869141_19743749746af9426cdc17c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Ivy興奮地品嚐著豐富的雪糕，大讚牛油果及果香濃郁，質感綿滑、非常美味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472036444869141_19743749746af9426cdc17c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy興奮地品嚐著豐富的雪糕，大讚牛油果及果香濃郁，質感綿滑、非常美味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17947203701726211_20998649226af94272c4492.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Ivy試食地道蜜糖餅，十分滋味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17947203701726211_20998649226af94272c4492.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy試食地道蜜糖餅，十分滋味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472037691493429_12579866756af942796f57f.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv 適逢荷蘭國王生日，Kit、Ivy與Terrence表弟一同在街頭參與慶祝並品嚐特色甜餅與小食。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472037691493429_12579866756af942796f57f.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>適逢荷蘭國王生日，Kit、Ivy與Terrence表弟一同在街頭參與慶祝並品嚐特色甜餅與小食。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472038539986859_7419553586af942820b172.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Ivy品嚐當地特式越南春卷。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472038539986859_7419553586af942820b172.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy品嚐當地特式越南春卷。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472033604492755_1129157346af94250ed150.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Terrence帶Ivy和Kit造訪Zwolle大城市，在當地著名的Snackbar品嚐獲得榮譽的冠軍新鮮薯條。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472033604492755_1129157346af94250ed150.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Terrence帶Ivy和Kit造訪Zwolle大城市，在當地著名的Snackbar品嚐獲得榮譽的冠軍新鮮薯條。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472034336889299_7299280176af94257da9f3.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Ivy很欣賞荷蘭的風土人情與悠閒生活。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472034336889299_7299280176af94257da9f3.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy很欣賞荷蘭的風土人情與悠閒生活。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472035001822314_9942672896af9425eae9b1.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Terrence帶Ivy和Kit到處觀光，並分享在當地的生活。他成功結合本地人的飲食喜好與香港美食精髓，讓荷蘭人與華人都喜愛他充滿人情味的港式餐館。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472035001822314_9942672896af9425eae9b1.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Terrence帶Ivy和Kit到處觀光，並分享在當地的生活。他成功結合本地人的飲食喜好與香港美食精髓，讓荷蘭人與華人都喜愛他充滿人情味的港式餐館。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472035667086712_6090263076af9426521248.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Terrence的表弟啟賢、Ivy和Kit在荷蘭的雪糕店挑戰極限，豪邁地購買了十球不同口味的雪糕。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472035667086712_6090263076af9426521248.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Terrence的表弟啟賢、Ivy和Kit在荷蘭的雪糕店挑戰極限，豪邁地購買了十球不同口味的雪糕。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/holland/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">holland</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ivy/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ivy</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/viutv/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ViuTV</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b8%af%e5%87%ba%e5%a5%bd%e5%91%b3%e9%81%93/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">港出好味道</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：ViuTV資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3543258\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 15 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T08:17:34.467853+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1835,"images":11,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T05:26:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T09:32:30.619958+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T08:11:33.396284+00:00","content_hash":"2ffcec4754b552eafb8d49acb0b7160b2ce4618c81f89669032cb259c88fe230","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}